+              Signals sent to your browser&apos;s credential manager to prune removed keys and update display names.
+            </p>
+          </div>
+          <div className="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 text-xs">
+            <span
+              className={`px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono ${
